event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":83,"item_id":"rs_0620a74ac78ab0aa016acb4c4758f887d19efa2c506602a6ec","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Evaluating file import tests**\n\nI need to test new file import helpers without exporting duplicate test helpers from the existing ones. To do this, I’ll add new tests by editing and inserting them before the first unique test. The test suite is around 160 lines long, focusing on verifying hidden counts and ranges in the forms and their summaries. I also need to ensure that no browser is permitted and that there are no dependencies involved."}

